system_settings_adminapitoken_title === Admin API Token
system_settings_adminapitoken_desc === This is the token for authenticating with the Admin API.
system_settings_systokenregen_desc === This token is critical for the security of your cronjobs, WhatsApp requests, and other system features. It must not be shared with anyone. If you believe the token has been compromised, you should regenerate a new one immediately. After regenerating, you will need to reconfigure your cronjobs and update any associated settings. Additionally, the WhatsApp system will be affected, and all connected accounts will stop working until they are re-linked again.
system_settings_aimod_title === AI Moderation
system_settings_aimod_desc === If enabled, all messages and images will go thru AI moderation model of OpenAI to check for flagged content.
system_settings_aimod_apikey_title === OpenAI API Key
system_settings_aimod_apikey_desc === Enter your OpenAI Apikey. The AI Moderation model of OpenAI is free of costs.
