form_addaikey_initailprompt_title === Initial Prompt
form_addaikey_initailprompt_desc === Enter the initial prompt for the AI. These are the intructions the AI should follow before starting the conversation.
form_addaikey_initailprompt_placeholder === eg. Act as a company representative. Answer general questions of the users about our company using the available tools.
form_addaikey_postprompt_title === Post Prompt
form_addaikey_postprompt_desc === This prompt will be automatically appended to each message, ensuring that the AI's responses remain strictly aligned with the specified context or topic. Use it to maintain a consistent and focused dialogue. Leave the field empty to disable this feature.
form_addaikey_postprompt_placeholder === eg. Do not give me any information about procedures and service features that are not mentioned in the PROVIDED CONTEXT.
form_addaikey_vision_title === Vision
form_addaikey_vision_desc === If enabled, the AI will respond to the received images.
form_addaikey_model_title === Model
form_addaikey_model_desc === Select the model you want the AI to use for responding to messages.
form_addaikey_modelsmartest === Smartest
form_addaikey_modelcheapest === Cheapest
form_addaikey_historythreshold_title === History Threshold
form_addaikey_historythreshold_desc === Enter the maximum number of conversation messages before the AI summarizes it to save tokens. Recommended value is 50.
form_addaikey_historythreshold_placeholder === eg. 50
form_addaikey_apikey_title === API Key
form_addaikey_apikey_desc === The API key you created from your AI provider dashboard.
form_addaiplugin_banner_title === Heads Up!
form_addaiplugin_banner_desc === Creating a plugin requires some extensive coding knowledge. If you are not sure about what you are doing, please consult with a developer.
form_addaiplugin_endpoint_title === Plugin Endpoint
form_addaiplugin_endpoint_desc === This is the URL that will be invoked by the AI. Your endpoint must strictly use POST method to capture AI parameters!
form_addaiplugin_schema_title === Plugin Schema
form_addaiplugin_schema_desc === These are instructions that the AI will follow whenn invoking the plugin. The format must be strictly followed!
